00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:06.370
They were then by Dreamhack given a
disqualification for the first map of

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:11.140
that best of three grand finals, meaning
North effectively just won the first map

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.040
