and that's just the way the cookie
crumbled I suppose I don't really know

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:29.050
what else to say about that other than
the process needs to be respected.

00:17:29.050 --> 00:17:34.480
They did show up late and played the second map. It was cobblestone and it was North

