kill you".

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:40.250
I think the community reaction towards
Immortals as an organisation is that

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:45.840
they've handled it professionally. Noah's
handled it professionally.

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:50.430
After losing the first map against CLG using our coach as a stand-in, henny and Lucas

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.610
