I can't believe this happened it was
like getting hit with one blow after

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:33.390
another it was almost a joke right
what's gonna go wrong next. What's gonna

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:37.200
happen with Immortals next
that's gonna collapse their roster for

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.860
the umpteenth time.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:46.710
Immortals' slow collapse continued over
the next few months as the teams signed

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:52.020
