were only going to get worse for

00:19:56.640 --> 00:20:01.060
Immortals, but before that happened
October came around and brought even more

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:08.080
instability to the EU LCS. Unicorns of Love
CEO Jos Mallant released an open letter in

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:12.550
which he stated that the current system
