losses every year. The same day,

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:24.220
Paris Saint-Germain dropped out of League of Legends
marking a huge blow to the future of EU

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:26.360
League of Legends.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:34.360
Paris Saint-Germain lose it in extra
time, S04 blow the final

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:39.450
whistle on Paris Saint-Germain challenger
series campaign. They were so close.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:46.420
Then November happened. Riot responded to the EU LCS doomsaying by claiming that

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:52.690
they were exploring the possibility of
franchising in 2019 and that relegation

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:59.170
