unclear what will happen, but all the

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:03.610
current EU LCS teams are still signed on
for another season.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:08.380
So the situation seems to have calmed
down, at least for now.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:12.700
Obviously I don't know what it's like to work for Riot and the regions are very different but it

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.570
