the franchising situation but maybe

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:20.200
franchising wouldn't work for Europe, I don't know, but it seems like a lot of the pros

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:24.010
in Europe they have a lot of pride and I
think a lot of the players that I've

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:29.200
